		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Bull, bear, and viper merged into a giant monster. One of the Tane, epic beasts made as living weapons by the fey.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 44, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 claws +7 (1d10) or 1 fire breath and chains, <strong>MV</strong> double near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Chains</strong>. All within near, DEX 15+ or bound in chains, cannot move. STR 15+ on turn to get free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fire Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from thrasfyr. DEX 15+ or 3d8 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
